---
// Recreation of their hot-magenta "G.U.A.P.Ø.S" post with the line-art disco ball.
---

<section class="bg-magenta relative overflow-hidden py-20 text-white sm:py-24" aria-label="G.U.A.P.Ø.S">
  <div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 opacity-25" style="background: radial-gradient(600px 400px at 50% 0%, #ffffff 0%, transparent 60%)"></div>

  <span class="sparkle text-3xl !text-white/90" style="top: 14%; left: 10%">✦</span>
  <span class="sparkle text-xl !text-white/80" style="top: 70%; left: 6%; animation-delay: 1.1s">✧</span>
  <span class="sparkle text-2xl !text-white/90" style="top: 22%; left: 88%; animation-delay: 0.6s">✦</span>
  <span class="sparkle text-xl !text-white/80" style="top: 78%; left: 92%; animation-delay: 1.8s">✧</span>

  <div class="relative mx-auto flex max-w-4xl flex-col items-center px-6 text-center">
    {/* line-art disco ball */}
    <svg viewBox="0 0 120 120" class="h-28 w-28 sm:h-36 sm:w-36" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" aria-hidden="true">
      <line x1="60" y1="0" x2="60" y2="14" />
      <circle cx="60" cy="62" r="46" />
      <path d="M14 62 h92 M18 44 h84 M18 80 h84 M28 28 h64 M28 96 h64" />
      <path d="M60 16 v92 M42 18 c-6 28 -6 60 0 88 M78 18 c6 28 6 60 0 88 M26 26 c-10 22 -10 50 0 72 M94 26 c10 22 10 50 0 72" />
    </svg>

    <p
      class="mt-8 font-display text-4xl tracking-[0.28em] uppercase sm:text-6xl sm:tracking-[0.35em]"
      style="font-family: var(--font-display)"
    >
      G.U.A.P.Ø.S
    </p>

    <p class="flyer-pill mt-8 border-white/70 text-white/90">✨ Guapøtivities ✨ <span class="normal-case">(n.)</span></p>
    <p class="mt-4 max-w-xl font-serif-display text-2xl italic text-white/95" style="font-family: var(--font-serif-display)">
      “The art of chasing miles with friends. Together we go further, finding
      beauty in the tough moments, but together.”
    </p>

    <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-3">
      <span class="flyer-pill border-white/70 text-white/90">Est. Dec 2024</span>
      <span class="flyer-pill border-white/70 text-white/90">Pilsen · Chicago</span>
      <span class="flyer-pill border-white/70 text-white/90">All paces</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
